+# --- the load barrier this queue shares with its clock (SAVE-P2-R02) ------------------------------
+
+func _barred() -> bool:
+	"""True while the bound clock holds a load barrier, which bars every ordinary mutation.
+
+	The barrier lives in `sim_clock.gd` and is raised by whoever is installing a world, so this
+	queue and its clock can never disagree about whether a load is open. There is no second flag
+	in this module, and no route here that lowers one.
